      "title": "Fit the cam locks",
      "cue": {
        "line1": "PRESS CAM LOCKS IN",
        "line2": "ARROW TOWARD THE EDGE"
      },
      "detail": "Press each cam lock into its round hole with the arrow pointing at the nearest panel edge. Do not turn it yet; turning happens when the bolt is in. Fixture text for the phone page.",
